;; hoshimori 星守 — seed orbital graph (real, PUBLIC regimes / operators / hazards / services)
;; ADR-2606073600 · vocabulary: orbit-ontology (00-contracts/schemas/orbit-ontology.kotoba.edn)
;;
;; SCOPE GUARD (constitutional, G1 — read first):
;;   - hoshimori is a STEWARDSHIP / orbital-sustainability map, NEVER a targeting / interception
;;     / weaponization aid. NO precise predictive ephemeris (no interception-grade state vector)
;;     appears here; all positional facts are orbital-shell / regime-AGGREGATE band labels.
;;   - The lens is ORBITAL-CONGESTION concentration vs STEWARDSHIP, routed to stewardship. The
;;     取-holder is the hazard/occupancy; the bearer is the regime + the public services that
;;     depend on it. karma lives ONLY on edges (:en/orbit-load; N1).
;;   - Mirrors ONLY already-public catalogs (object counts, regime defs, disposal rules, named
;;     public debris EVENTS). ASAT / kinetic-intercept uses are unrepresentable (§1.12).
;;
;; SOURCING: orbital-regime definitions, public constellation existence + home jurisdiction,
;;   and named public debris EVENTS (e.g. 2007 FY-1C, 2021 Cosmos 1408) are :authoritative; the
;;   SAMPLE is a bounded illustrative seed (:representative coverage), NOT exhaustive, and
;;   orbit-load values are representative severities, NOT measured conjunction probabilities. No
;;   fabricated coverage. Live catalog ingest (space-track/CelesTrak-shaped public feeds) is
;;   G7/Council-gated. Regime/event facts are DISCLOSED, never hoshimori adjudications (N3).

